end="00:47.638">love </span><span begin="00:47.638" end="00:48.196">you </span><span begin="00:48.196" end="00:48.564">right</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.705" end="00:51.369"><span begin="00:48.705" end="00:49.001">I'm </span><span begin="00:49.001" end="00:50.025">happy </span><span begin="00:50.025" end="00:50.313">for </span><span begin="00:50.313" end="00:51.369">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.725" end="00:56.889"><span begin="00:52.725" end="00:53.165">I </span><span begin="00:53.165" end="00:53.381">just </span><span begin="00:53.381" end="00:54.693">wanna </span><span begin="00:54.693" end="00:55.117">take </span><span begin="00:55.117" end="00:55.621">it </span><span begin="00:55.621" end="00:56.889">slow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.889" end="01:01.024"><span begin="00:56.889" end="00:57.057">I'll </span><span begin="00:57.057" end="00:57.473">live </span><span begin="00:57.473" end="00:57.785">and </span><span begin="00:57.785" end="00:58.425">learn </span><span begin="00:58.425" end="00:58.791">go </span><span begin="00:58.791" end="00:59.383">with </span><span begin="00:59.383" end="00:59.975">the </span><span begin="00:59.975" end="01:01.024">flow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.024" end="01:05.784"><span begin="01:01.024" end="01:01.240">What </span><span begin="01:01.240" end="01:02.080">doesn't </span><span begin="01:02.080" end="01:02.552">kill </span><span begin="01:02.552" end="01:03.120">you </span><span begin="01:03.120" end="01:03.672">makes </span><span begin="01:03.672" end="01:04.128">you </span><span begin="01:04.128" end="01:04.992">stronger </span><span begin="01:04.992" end="01:05.784">so</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.784" end="01:09.128"><span begin="01:05.784" end="01:06.033">You </span><span begin="01:06.033" end="01:06.352">won't </span><span begin="01:06.352" end="01:06.648">see </span><span begin="01:06.648" end="01:06.880">me </span><span begin="01:06.880" end="01:07.128">on </span><span begin="01:07.128" end="01:07.416">my </span><span begin="01:07.416" end="01:09.128">knees</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.128" end="01:09.944"><span begin="01:09.128" end="01:09.560">Loosen </span><span begin="01:09.560" end="01:09.944">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.324" end="01:13.258"><span begin="01:10.324" end="01:10.852">Just </span><span begin="01:10.852" end="01:11.955">broken </span><span begin="01:11.955" end="01:13.258">hearted</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.383" end="01:17.511"><span begin="01:14.383" end="01:14.607">Don't </span><span begin="01:14.607" end="01:15.095">think </span><span begin="01:15.095" end="01:15.447">about </span><span begin="01:15.447" end="01:15.903">it </span><span begin="01:15.903" end="01:16.167">don't </span><span begin="01:16.167" end="01:16.679">think </span><span begin="01:16.679" end="01:17.303">about </span><span begin="01:17.303" end="01:17.511">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.511" end="01:18.551"><span begin="01:17.511" end="01:17.831">Wish </span><span begin="01:17.831" end="01:18.151">you </span><span begin="01:18.151" end="01:18.551">luck</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.019" end="01:21.691"><span begin="01:19.019" end="01:19.917">Without </span><span begin="01:19.917" end="01:20.538">me </span><span begin="01:20.538" end="01:21.691">darling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.051" end="01:26.045"><span begin="01:22.051" end="01:22.347">Cuz </span><span begin="01:22.347" end="01:22.948">I </span><span begin="01:22.948" end="01:23.292">don't </span><span begin="01:23.292" end="01:23.547">care </span><span begin="01:23.547" end="01:23.947">about </span><span begin="01:23.947" end="01:24.451">it </span><span begin="01:24.451" end="01:24.755">don't </span><span begin="01:24.755" end="01:25.259">care </span><span begin="01:25.259" end="01:25.587">about </span><span begin="01:25.587" end="01:26.045">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.223" end="